<title>SOUTH AFRICA: MACMED LINKS WITH GE , MAKES TWO BUYS.</title>
<headline>MACMED LINKS WITH GE , MAKES TWO BUYS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Macmed Health Care Ltd said on Friday it proposed to form a strategic alliance with the medical division of GE South Africa (Pty) Ltd and had acquired Med-X Ray (Pty) Ltd and X Ray Imaging Services (Pty) Ltd for 24 million rand.</p>
<p>As the first phase of the alliance with GE, Macmed will become the distributor for GE Medical Ultra Sound Systems. The ultimate intention is to form a joint venture, the company added.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
